CRITICAL: Crazy rumors about DC’s upcoming projects from Daniel RPK:

- The Flash will take a fresh look at past DCEU films, exploring alternate storylines that open up new directions. Notably, all previous movies will remain canon within their own timelines—no reboots;
- The Barry Allen film will also serve as a prequel to the upcoming Justice League installment. Whether it continues Snyder’s storyline remains unclear;
- The studio is developing a solo movie for the Atom. No confirmation yet on whether Orion Lee will reprise his role from Zack Snyder’s Justice League;
- Wonder Woman 3 will introduce Nubia, a key ally of Diana Prince—and she’s set to headline her own standalone film down the line.

